Z||000019||Cliff Pennock||01-16-2001||03:11 AM||||Good points, all. So there needs to be some extra text between "...got the ball rolling." and "This page is for...". I was thinking something along the lines of:<P><B>Since we do not know if Anthony is able or willing to drive a car again, we at PFF leave it to the family to decide how the donation is spent.</B><P>Any suggestions for additions or changes to this?||||reg||1
